# PRES-MIRAGE -- W5-PRES R-047: an enemy Mirage tank that stands still is
# drawn as its DefaultMirageDisguises tree (agent C's u.w5.mirage_tree; before
# that lands run with RA2_PRES_MIRAGE=TREE05 to exercise the draw path); the
# player's own still Mirage stays a tank.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click start
until 90 scene == game
require scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
cheat spawn MGTK 1 building 0:GACNST -6 +9
cheat spawn MGTK 0 building 0:GACNST -9 +9
cheat spawn MGTK 1 building 0:GACNST -6 +11
wait 40
cheat view_unit RTNK 0
wait 1
shot mirage
end
